{#- The plain-text twin of the signature email/base.html.twig adds to every
    HTML e-mail. Included by every shipped `.text.twig` so both halves of a
    message are signed the same way; a customised e-mail has only one body
    and gets its text half derived from the HTML, signature included.

    Twig swallows the newline right after a `%}`, so every line break in
    the footer note below is one that follows a `}}`: the note and its
    link on two lines. -#}
Bien à vous,
{{ site_name }}
{% if footer_note is defined and footer_note %}

{{ footer_note }}
{% if footer_link is defined and footer_link %}{{ footer_link }}
{% endif %}
{% endif %}

